    "body": "According to the notify_rust docs `.icon()` needs to be freedesktop.org compliant. Would [\"utilities-terminal\"](https://specifications.freedesktop.org/icon-naming-spec/icon-naming-spec-latest.html#names) be a more standard choice here?\r\n\r\nMore importantly, does \"utilities-terminal\" even work, or does it throw up a generic \"no icon\" icon?",
