    "body": "It's not clear to me why this has to be a separate module-creating function instead of just a modification to `cmd_duration`, but if we're going this route, this function should be placed in cmd_duration, not in `mod.rs`.\r\n\r\nIf at all possible, I would prefer that this PR just modify the behaviour of the cmd_duration module so that we don't have to deal with the cognitive overhead of this wrapping when reading code in the future.",
